{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1311598-selkies-mate-with-seals","id":1311598,"title":"Selkies mate with Seals?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-05-12T12:37:05-07:00","id":1311598,"title":"Selkies mate with Seals?","content":"I Remeber a line in the Selkie book where it Metions That Seals with Selkie Blood sometimes becomes Selkies. Does that mean that Selkies sometimes fuck seals.<br /> <br /> Does that mean a Pooka could Shapeshift and Mate with their animals and then have Fae blood Cubs?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-12T13:31:13-07:00","id":1311601,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1311598-selkies-mate-with-seals#post1311598\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I Remeber a line in the Selkie book</div> </div> </div> </div>...what Selkie book? There isn't a Selkie kithbook.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-12T13:46:17-07:00","id":1311604,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1311598-selkies-mate-with-seals?p=1311601#post1311601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...what Selkie book? There isn't a Selkie kithbook.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's in their original writeup in Immortal Eyes: The Toybox. (And in a setting with the various animal-breed Fera, you can see where the idea came from.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-12T14:49:16-07:00","id":1311613,"title":"","content":"And yes there is nothing stopping Pooka from getting frisky with their animal equivalent when shapeshifted but one could interpret them being unable to impregnate, or become impregnated by, animals as the Pooka Reproduction on p.47 of Kithbook: Pooka only mentions human babies being born to the Pooka, due to their Faerie souls inhabiting human bodies. As a side note Pooka in animal form is unhindered by her pregnancy and doesn\u2019t even show it no matter the month she is on. On the other hand when birthcontractions begin they automatically revert to human form to give birth.<br /> <br /> But on the other hand if it is something you want in your games to be a thing then go for it. It is a minor House Rule that shouldn\u2019t come up too often to rule them able to procreate when shapeshifted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1629-possessed","name":"Possessed","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1629_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-12T16:30:39-07:00","id":1311630,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1311598-selkies-mate-with-seals?p=1311604#post1311604\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's in their original writeup in Immortal Eyes: The Toybox. (And in a setting with the various animal-breed Fera, you can see where the idea came from.)</div> </div> </div> </div>I got a idea a male Selkie with a Beachmasters Coat.<br /> <br /> He sets up shop in some Prime seal Real instate and wait for The lady seals using his Kithin powers to Beat the shit out of Any other Challenging males.<br /> <br /> He does what the Beachmaster does and impregnates all of his Harem to have Seal babies with Fae Blood. That have a chance of becoming Selkies.<br /> <br /> Sense Selkies pass there Coats to a Worthy Heir it well probably by a Medium size operation. With Many Selkies and Possible other Kithin helping them Maybe even some Selkies born from seals","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-12T18:05:52-07:00","id":1311664,"title":"","content":"And nothing stops some sidhe going all Zeus with Metamorphosis, but I'm going to argue Selkie by their nature can't be Born of seals. THeir power is to turn into seals. You put a seal coat on a Seal.. it becomes another Seal. So presumably your &quot;Seal breed&quot; Selkies would need human skin coats...(oooh that sounds fun..)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-12T18:18:03-07:00","id":1311668,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Possessed</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1311598-selkies-mate-with-seals?p=1311613#post1311613\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And yes there is nothing stopping Pooka from getting frisky with their animal equivalent when shapeshifted but one could interpret them being unable to impregnate, or become impregnated by, animals as the Pooka Reproduction on p.47 of Kithbook: Pooka only mentions human babies being born to the Pooka, due to their Faerie souls inhabiting human bodies.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not being able to knock up a seal with a human is the <i>boring</i> interpretation though. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-12T19:22:45-07:00","id":1311686,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1311598-selkies-mate-with-seals?p=1311664#post1311664\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And nothing stops some sidhe going all Zeus with Metamorphosis, but I'm going to argue Selkie by their nature can't be Born of seals. THeir power is to turn into seals. You put a seal coat on a Seal.. it becomes another Seal. So presumably your &amp;quot;Seal breed&amp;quot; Selkies would need human skin coats...(oooh that sounds fun..)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> But yeah how do Normal selkie Get there Seal Skin they Don\u2019t do the Changeling way so how did the First Selkies come to by? <br /> From immortal Eyes Toybox<br /> <br /> .Occasionally a seal with selkie ancestry learns to shed its skin and take on human shape,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-12T19:29:05-07:00","id":1311688,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1311598-selkies-mate-with-seals?p=1311686#post1311686\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> But yeah how do Normal selkie Get there Seal Skin they Don\u2019t do the Changeling way so how did the First Selkies come to by?<br /> From immortal Eyes Toybox<br /> <br /> .Occasionally a seal with selkie ancestry learns to shed its skin and take on human shape,</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The first selkies were women with magical seal coats... Its like asking &quot;where did the first Satyr come from some guy fucking a goat?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-12T19:41:01-07:00","id":1311689,"title":"","content":"But how did they Get the Seal Coats?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-12T20:41:11-07:00","id":1311697,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1311598-selkies-mate-with-seals?p=1311689#post1311689\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But how did they Get the Seal Coats?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> its part of their fairy nature. Like how every Kithain is born with Voile","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-13T07:06:05-07:00","id":1311775,"title":"","content":"For my own campaign(s), I would say yes, it is possible. Same thing with shape-shifted Pooka. There is enough of this sort of thing in folklore to make a solid case. I would also add that a shapeshifted Fae can forget their fae nature and live out their lives as an animal. Kinain animals are not out of the question either.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cHumpty had always sat on walls, it was his way.\u201d </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2015 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Jasper Fforde, </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/work/quotes/2504943\" target=\"_blank\">The Big Over Easy</a></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","name":"MythAdvocate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1756_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-13T08:47:31-07:00","id":1311789,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1311598-selkies-mate-with-seals?p=1311601#post1311601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> ...what Selkie book? There isn't a Selkie kithbook.</div> </div> </div> </div>Isnt it a selkie kithbook?<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/261699/Kithbook-Selkie\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/images/1/261699.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/261699/Kithbook-Selkie\" target=\"_blank\"> Kithbook: Selkie - White Wolf | DriveThruRPG.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/261699/Kithbook-Selkie\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/261699/Kithbook-Selkie </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Kithbook: Selkie - This title has since been updated with revised text, delving more deeply into the rivalry between the Selkies and the no </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Drivethru says it was published by WhiteWolf, so I inclined to believe it is cannon.<br /> <br /> Also, it seems to answer all the question like where did they get the coat and everything. Not sure if answer about seal-selkie offsprings, but might.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12934-manbat","name":"Manbat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12934_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-13T09:35:54-07:00","id":1311799,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manbat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1311598-selkies-mate-with-seals?p=1311789#post1311789\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Isnt it a selkie kithbook?<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/261699/Kithbook-Selkie\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/images/1/261699.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/261699/Kithbook-Selkie\" target=\"_blank\"> Kithbook: Selkie - White Wolf | DriveThruRPG.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/261699/Kithbook-Selkie\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/261699/Kithbook-Selkie </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Kithbook: Selkie - This title has since been updated with revised text, delving more deeply into the rivalry between the Selkies and the no </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Drivethru says it was published by WhiteWolf, so I inclined to believe it is cannon.<br /> <br /> Also, it seems to answer all the question like where did they get the coat and everything. Not sure if answer about seal-selkie offsprings, but might.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's a fanmade STVault product.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-13T09:54:58-07:00","id":1311804,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1311598-selkies-mate-with-seals#post1311598\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Does that mean a Pooka could Shapeshift and Mate with their animals and then have Fae blood Cubs?</div> </div> </div> </div>I asked the Pookas about this, and they told me I was being ridiculous. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-13T12:26:07-07:00","id":1311836,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1311598-selkies-mate-with-seals?p=1311804#post1311804\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I asked the Pookas about this, and they told me I was being ridiculous. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, it\u2019s clear from what Possessed cited that the kids would still be human. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-13T13:01:21-07:00","id":1311854,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MythAdvocate</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1311598-selkies-mate-with-seals?p=1311775#post1311775\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For my own campaign(s), I would say yes, it is possible. Same thing with shape-shifted Pooka. There is enough of this sort of thing in folklore to make a solid case. I would also add that a shapeshifted Fae can forget their fae nature and live out their lives as an animal. Kinain animals are not out of the question either.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm of a general opinion that &quot;normal&quot; animals awakening to their supernatural nature is more a werewolf thing. Now a shapeshifting fairy cat... was always a fairy cat in myth that's at least where i'd draw the line. How that would work with changeling? I'd allow them on Arcadian Commoners, but not Autumn commoners.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Also there's no real limitation to Pooka/selkie/snake people from pg as being the only ones who can knock people up as animals. Metamorphosis is right there. You want a Horse with Sidhe blood.. go zeus it up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-13T13:17:39-07:00","id":1311855,"title":"","content":"Yeah, do Sayters sometimes fuck Goats?<br /> <br /> Of course with the Goats Consent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-13T15:48:01-07:00","id":1311886,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"